+* **Required Model/Tool/API:** Local regex pattern matcher.
+* **Secret/Permission Needs:** None.
+* **Privacy/Security Risks:** Low (protects user privacy).
+* **Offline Feasibility:** 100% Offline.
+* **Estimated Complexity:** **S**
