+* **Required Model/Tool/API:** Standard LLM.
+* **Secret/Permission Needs:** None.
+* **Privacy/Security Risks:** Low.
+* **Offline Feasibility:** Yes.
+* **Estimated Complexity:** **M**
+* **Fit with Corez:** **HIGH** (Extends current `PUBLIC_USER_INTENT_PROMPT`).
