+* **Privacy/Security Risks:** Moderate (infinite loop risk; capped by max step count).
+* **Offline Feasibility:** No.
+* **Estimated Complexity:** **L**
+* **Fit with Corez:** **HIGH** (Unlocks true agentic power).
